WEBVTT

00:00:15.423 --> 00:00:18.551
Travelers of Narnia, welcome.
纳尼亚的行者

00:00:21.304 --> 00:00:22.472
Arise.
起来吧

00:00:25.516 --> 00:00:26.893
Are you not hungry?
你们不饿吗？

00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:28.853
Who are you?
你是谁？

00:00:28.937 --> 00:00:32.190
I'm Liliandil,
daughter of Ramandu.
我是莉莲迪尔，拉曼杜的女儿

00:00:32.941 --> 00:00:34.567
I am your guide.
也是你们的向导

00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:39.614
You're a star?
你是星宿？

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:48.915
You are most beautiful.
你的美丽无人可比

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:52.835
I-If it is a distraction for you,
I-I can change form.
如果你们感到困扰，我可以改变外形

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.254
-No.
-No.
不

00:00:55.797 --> 00:00:57.048
LILIANDIL: Please.
请吧

00:00:59.217 --> 00:01:00.635
The food is for you.
食物是给你们准备的

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:05.098
There is enough for all who are
welcome at Aslan's table.
受到阿斯兰邀请的人可以尽情享用

00:01:06.349 --> 00:01:08.851
Always.
H-Help yourselves.
请用餐吧

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.398
Wait! What happened to them?
等等

00:01:14.899 --> 00:01:18.194
LILIANDIL: These poor men were half-mad
by the time they reached our shores.
那些可怜人在上岸时已经处于癫狂状态

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.655
They were threatening violence
upon each other.
彼此间开始相互残杀

00:01:20.738 --> 00:01:23.950
Violence is forbidden
at the table of Aslan,
阿斯兰的餐桌严禁暴力

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:25.952
so they were sent to sleep.
所以他们被催眠了

00:01:26.703 --> 00:01:28.162
Will they ever wake?
他们还能醒来吗？

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:30.832
When all is put right.
那要等你们成功之后

00:01:30.915 --> 00:01:33.251
Come, there is little time.
来吧

00:01:50.893 --> 00:01:54.063
The magician, Coriakin,
told you of Dark Island?
魔法师克里亚金对你们说过黑暗岛吗？

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.524
Yes.
说过

00:02:01.696 --> 00:02:03.948
Before long, the evil will be unstoppable.
那里的妖魔即将主宰全世界

00:02:04.949 --> 00:02:06.576
Coriakin said to break its spell,
克里亚金说将七把宝剑
放到阿斯兰的餐桌上就能打破魔咒

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.453
we lay the seven swords
at Aslan's table.
克里亚金说将七把宝剑
放到阿斯兰的餐桌上就能打破魔咒

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:10.913
He speaks the truth.
他说得没错

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.498
But we only found six.
可是我们只找到六把

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:14.918
Do you know
where the seventh is?
你知道第七把在哪儿吗？

00:02:16.711 --> 00:02:18.504
In there.
在那儿

00:02:18.588 --> 00:02:20.465
You will need great courage.
拿到它需要极大的勇气

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.556
Now, waste no time.
好吧，时间不多了

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:33.353
I hope we meet again.
希望我们还能见面

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:37.315
Goodbye.
再见

00:02:46.824 --> 00:02:48.743
(whooshing)

00:02:52.413 --> 00:02:55.333
(rumbling)

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:05.843
So, what do you think is in there?
你们认为那里有什么？

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.263
Our worst nightmares.
最可怕的恶梦

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:10.890
Our darkest wishes.
最邪恶的欲望

00:03:12.183 --> 00:03:13.685
Pure evil.
充满恐怖

00:03:16.938 --> 00:03:19.941
Tavros, unlock the armory.
塔罗斯，打开武器库

00:03:20.024 --> 00:03:21.234
My lord.
是，大人

00:03:21.317 --> 00:03:23.653
Archers, prepare yourselves.
弓箭手，做好准备

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:24.946
CREWMAN: Aye, Captain.
是，船长

00:03:25.029 --> 00:03:26.656
Light the lanterns.
点起灯火

00:03:27.323 --> 00:03:28.866
Let's get ready.
准备开始吧

00:03:34.789 --> 00:03:38.293
When I grow up,
I want to be just like you.
等我长大了，也要像你一样

00:03:46.384 --> 00:03:47.510
When you grow up...
等你长大了

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:52.640
...you should be just like you.
要做真正的自己

00:04:02.233 --> 00:04:05.278
In case we don't get through...
whatever this is...
此去吉凶难料，生死未卜

00:04:07.196 --> 00:04:09.449
...I want you to know I think
of you as my brother, Ed.
我想说我一直把你当成亲兄弟，埃德

00:04:10.074 --> 00:04:11.200
Me, too.
我也是

00:04:16.706 --> 00:04:17.915
You gave up your sword.
你放弃了你的宝剑

00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:20.585
It wasn't mine to keep.
原本就不是我的

00:04:25.089 --> 00:04:26.299
Use this.
用这个吧

00:04:27.717 --> 00:04:30.428
-But it's...
-Peter would want you to have it.
彼得一定希望你用它

00:04:39.854 --> 00:04:41.981
REEPICHEEP: There it is, my friend.
这样吧，我的朋友

00:04:42.065 --> 00:04:44.025
Our battle awaits.
咱们暂且休战

00:04:45.109 --> 00:04:48.446
Aah! Eustace, no! Halt!
尤斯塔斯，不

00:04:48.529 --> 00:04:50.490
Eustace, stop! Stop!
尤斯塔斯，停下

00:04:50.573 --> 00:04:52.325
(yells)
尤斯塔斯，停下

00:04:52.408 --> 00:04:55.244
I will not accept surrender.
我可不想投降

00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:58.039
A noble warrior does not run from fear.
高贵的武士决不会临阵脱逃

00:04:58.122 --> 00:05:00.959
Look at me!
Look at me when I'm talking to you.
看着我，我说话时你要看着我

00:05:03.962 --> 00:05:05.588
I am a mouse.
我是一只老鼠

00:05:05.672 --> 00:05:07.590
You... you're a dragon.
你，你是一条龙

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:10.551
You've got skin like chain mail.
你浑身长满铠甲，口吐火焰

00:05:10.635 --> 00:05:12.262
You breathe fire.
你浑身长满铠甲，口吐火焰

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:14.514
Come on, let's meet our destiny.
来吧，让我们为理想而战

00:05:22.313 --> 00:05:24.607
CASPIAN: No matter what happens here,
无论发生什么事情

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:27.193
every soul who stands before me
has earned their place
我面前的每一个人
都将无愧于黎明踏浪号

00:05:27.277 --> 00:05:29.654
on the crew of the Dawn Treader.
赋予我们的使命

00:05:30.405 --> 00:05:32.865
Together we have traveled far.
我们一同远航

00:05:32.949 --> 00:05:34.742
Together we have faced adversity.
我们克服了重重困难

00:05:34.826 --> 00:05:37.745
Together we can do it again.
我们还会一如既往

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.749
So now is not the time to fall
to fear's temptations.
现在已经到了最后决战的关健时刻

00:05:41.833 --> 00:05:44.377
Be strong. Never give in.
要坚强，永不言败

00:05:45.503 --> 00:05:47.589
Our world--
我们的世界

00:05:47.672 --> 00:05:49.841
our Narnian lives-- depend on it.
我们的纳尼亚看着我们

00:05:51.217 --> 00:05:52.885
Think of the lost souls
we're here to save.
想想那些等待我们拯救的冤魂

00:05:57.473 --> 00:05:58.766
Think of Aslan.
想想阿斯兰

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.936
Think of Narnia.
想想纳尼亚

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.771
CREWMAN: For Narnia!
-为了纳尼亚
-为了纳尼亚

00:06:03.855 --> 00:06:06.649
CREW: For Narnia! For Narnia!
-为了纳尼亚
-为了纳尼亚

00:06:06.733 --> 00:06:08.359
For Narnia!
为了纳尼亚

00:06:08.443 --> 00:06:10.028
(crew shouting heartily)

00:06:10.111 --> 00:06:13.072
For Narnia! For Narnia!

00:06:18.453 --> 00:06:20.663
(rumbling)

00:06:30.214 --> 00:06:33.051
(eerie voices whispering)

00:06:44.228 --> 00:06:45.939
(whispering continues)

